 A bare clone plus worktrees has no sole writer to send anyone to
 stepstone CLI: /home/max/.no-mistakes/worktrees/b8259d22ae4a/01KZY8TBFZE2AN1VZDZER70WS8/src/cli.ts
 git 2.43.0, node v24.18.1
